error[9-0004]: duplicate selector in msg block
   ┌─ msg_selector_signature_provenance.fe:31:5
   │
29 │     #[selector = std::abi::sol("burn(uint256)")]
   │     -------------------------------------------- `Burn` with selector 0x42966c68 declared here
30 │     Burn { amount: u256 } -> u256,
31 │     #[selector = std::abi::sol("collate_propagate_storage(bytes16)")]
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `Collate` has selector 0x42966c68 which conflicts with `Burn`
   │
   = each variant in a msg block must have a unique selector

error[9-0006]: selector declares `bytes16` but field `amount` has ABI type `uint256`
   ┌─ msg_selector_signature_provenance.fe:32:15
   │
32 │     Collate { amount: u256 } -> u256,
   │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^ expected a `bytes16`-typed value
   │
   = `std::abi::Bytes16` decodes and encodes Solidity `bytes16`

error[9-0007]: selector signature declares 2 argument(s) but msg variant `TwoArgs` has 1 field(s)
   ┌─ msg_selector_signature_provenance.fe:44:5
   │
44 │     #[selector = std::abi::sol(S)]
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ selector signature arity does not match the variant's fields

error[9-0009]: malformed selector signature `a b(uint64)` for msg variant `Spaced`
   ┌─ msg_selector_signature_provenance.fe:37:5
   │
37 │     #[selector = h("a b(uint64)")]
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ selector function name must be a single identifier
   │
